id pump-controller
title Propose a pump setpoint, safely
lang eve
audience water utilities, industrial and plant operators
safety advisory
summary A setpoint inside hard Eve ranges becomes a proposal for an operator. Out-of-range is refused; two gauges that disagree are held.
inputs inputs.txt
step advisory eve proposal.eve advisory type=proposal sensors=pressure_a,pressure_b tolerance=10.0
